    "question": {
      ":question/problem": "A curve is defined by the parametric equations\n$x = 4t + 12, y =  - 3(t - 5)^{3} - 1, - ∞ < t < ∞$.\n\nDetermine the values of $t$ at which the tangent to the curve is horizontal.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
